*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*%
*% Samsung CLP-300 - PrinterManager driver (Ghostscript + foo2qpdl)
*% https://github.com/emregms/printer-manager
*%
*% Pages are converted by /Library/Printers/PrinterManager/Filters/pdftoqpdl,
*% which uses the parameters of foo2zjs' foo2qpdl-wrapper for the CLP-300
*% (-z0, A4). Copies, page ranges and N-up are applied by macOS cgpdftopdf.
*%
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "CLP300PM.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Samsung"
*Product: "(CLP-300)"
*ModelName: "Samsung CLP-300 PrinterManager"
*ShortNickName: "Samsung CLP-300 PrinterManager"
*NickName: "Samsung CLP-300 PrinterManager (foo2qpdl)"
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:Samsung;CMD:SPLC;MDL:CLP-300;CLS:PRINTER;"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: True
*DefaultColorSpace: RGB
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "4"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.3
*cupsLanguages: "tr"
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsFilter2: "application/vnd.cups-pdf application/vnd.cups-raw 0 /Library/Printers/PrinterManager/Filters/pdftoqpdl"

*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: A4
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*% Margins: 3.175 mm left/right, 4.23 mm top/bottom (foo2zjs CLP-300)
*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*ImageableArea A4/A4: "9 12 586 830"
*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
*PaperDimension A4/A4: "595 842"

*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: Color
*ColorModel Color/Color: ""
*ColorModel Gray/Grayscale: ""
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*OpenUI *Resolution/Quality: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 1200x600dpi
*Resolution 600x600dpi/600 dpi (fast): ""
*Resolution 1200x600dpi/1200x600 dpi (recommended): ""
*Resolution 1200x1200dpi/1200x1200 dpi (best): ""
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenUI *PageDelay/Delay Between Pages: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *PageDelay
*DefaultPageDelay: 40
*PageDelay 0/Off: ""
*PageDelay 20/20 seconds: ""
*PageDelay 30/30 seconds: ""
*PageDelay 40/40 seconds: ""
*PageDelay 60/60 seconds: ""
*CloseUI: *PageDelay

*% Turkish
*tr.Translation PageSize/Kağıt Boyutu: ""
*tr.PageSize A4/A4: ""
*tr.Translation PageRegion/Kağıt Boyutu: ""
*tr.PageRegion A4/A4: ""
*tr.Translation ColorModel/Renk: ""
*tr.ColorModel Color/Renkli: ""
*tr.ColorModel Gray/Siyah-beyaz: ""
*tr.Translation Resolution/Kalite: ""
*tr.Resolution 600x600dpi/600 dpi (hızlı): ""
*tr.Resolution 1200x600dpi/1200x600 dpi (önerilen): ""
*tr.Resolution 1200x1200dpi/1200x1200 dpi (en iyi): ""
*tr.Translation PageDelay/Sayfa Arası Bekleme (belt temizliği): ""
*tr.PageDelay 0/Kapalı: ""
*tr.PageDelay 20/20 saniye: ""
*tr.PageDelay 30/30 saniye: ""
*tr.PageDelay 40/40 saniye: ""
*tr.PageDelay 60/60 saniye: ""

*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier: Standard "(002.004S)" Standard ROM
*% End of Samsung-CLP-300-PrinterManager.ppd
